<title>GREECE: GREECE TO AUCTION 3YR, 10.2 PCT BONDS, 7YR FRN JAN 24.</title>
<headline>GREECE TO AUCTION 3YR, 10.2 PCT BONDS, 7YR FRN JAN 24.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will auction 120 billion drachmas worth of 3-year, 10.20 percent coupon bonds and 250 billion drachmas of seven-year floaters with the first annual coupon set at 12.40 percent, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
</text>
